** BFP replication — canonical top-level globals
** INSTRUCTIONS: Edit the three paths below to match your local directory layout,
** then save this file. These globals are used by make_globals.do to set all
** downstream paths.
**
**   BFPrep_codedir : absolute path to the code/ folder of this repo
**   BFPrep_datadir : absolute path to the directory containing the raw data
**   BFPrep_outdir  : absolute path to the directory where outputs will be written

global BFPrep_codedir "/path/to/code"
global BFPrep_datadir "/path/to/data"
global BFPrep_outdir  "/path/to/output"


